    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "REPLACE_WITH_FINANCE_EMAIL",
        "subject": "=APPROVED: Issue catch-up invoices for {{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.message.text.match(/Client:\\s*(.+)/)[1].trim() }} ({{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.message.text.match(/Arrears Found:\\s*(\\S+)/)[1] }})",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Finance team,\n\nThe billing reconciliation for {{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.message.text.match(/Client:\\s*(.+)/)[1].trim() }} (contract {{ ($('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.message.text.match(/Contract:\\s*(.+)/) || [])[1] || 'n/a' }}) has been reviewed and approved.\n\nPlease issue catch-up invoices for the following under-billed periods:\n\n{{ $('Get Approved Leaks').all().map(i => i.json.invoice_number + ': $' + Number(i.json.calculated_arrears).toLocaleString('en-US', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 })).sort().join('\\n') }}\n\nTotal approved arrears: {{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.message.text.match(/Arrears Found:\\s*(\\S+)/)[1] }}\n\nWhy these were under-billed:\n{{ ($('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.message.text.match(/Why:\\n([\\s\\S]*?)\\n\\nContract citations/) || [])[1] || '' }}\n\nEach amount is tied to a verified clause in the signed contract and is recorded in the detected_leaks ledger with status APPROVED. The line-by-line audit report was attached to the approval card.\n\nApproved by: {{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.from.first_name }}{{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.from.username ? ' (@' + $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.callback_query.from.username + ')' : '' }}\nApproved at: {{ $now.toFormat('MMMM d, yyyy h:mm a ZZZZ') }}\n\nSent automatically by System #001: Deterministic Billing Reconciler.",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
